    "text": "120-observation rolling regression of daily DXY log returns on changes in the US-minus-foreign rate spread. The score is the 20-observation residual sum divided by its trailing, up-to-252-observation standard deviation, without subtracting the mean. The 60-observation normalization is a separate sensitivity check, not confirmation. The five-day flag is separate. Actual available-basket weights, not causal contributions: {'eur2y': 1.0}. GBP uses a short-rate proxy; basket coverage and tenors differ.",
